            "review_title": "Review at Thai Express",
            "review_text": "eileent3821\nKuala Lumpur, Malaysia2474 contributions\n2\nTOTALLY UNIMPRESSED\nNov 2019\nThe owner of Thai Express should ensure all the locations are complying with the recipes and standards, so as to prevent disappointment. I have lived in Thailand for 3 years plus hence I am very familiar with the menu as well as taste and standard. Service was way below standards and the staff were very slow even when there were not many guests. The taste is not too Thai, probably they modify it to suit the local taste. I would say it's overpriced for this kind of food quality and service.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten January 22, 2020",
