            "review_title": "Review at Thai Express",
            "review_text": "Jason S\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam44 contributions\n0\nHow can 'express' be so slow?\nDec 2019 • Couples\nSat at the table for 10-15 minutes after they gave us our menus, and no one came by to help us. I am aware of the fact that local places in Saigon require you to wave the servers over. This is neither local, nor at that price point. I expect someone to come by at some point when our menus are closed and we are clearly waiting to be served. Too many places in this neighbourhood with Western service. This place needs to get with it.\nRead more\nWritten December 28, 2019",
